<rt>zǐ xì</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"de\" data-defn=\"-ly / structural particle: used before a verb or adjective, linking it to preceding modifying adverbial adjunct\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">地</span><span class=\"tr\">地</span><rt>de</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tiāo\" data-defn=\"to carry on a shoulder pole / to choose / to pick / to nitpick\" data-hsk=\"HSK 5\"><span class=\"si\">挑</span><span class=\"tr\">挑</span><rt>tiāo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"píng guǒ\" data-defn=\"apple\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">苹果</span><span class=\"tr\">蘋果</span><rt>píng guǒ</rt></ruby>。<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"zhè\" data-defn=\"this; these\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">这</span><span class=\"tr\">這</span><rt>zhè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"shí\" data-defn=\"o&#x27;clock / time / hour / season / period\" data-hsk=\"HSK 2(6)\"><span class=\"si\">时</span><span class=\"tr\">時</span><rt>shí</rt></ruby>，<ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"yī\" data-defn=\"one / single / a (article)\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">一</span><span class=\"tr\">一</span><rt>yī</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"gè\" data-defn=\"classifier for people or objects in general\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">个</span><span class=\"tr\">個</span><rt>gè</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"xiǎo\" data-defn=\"young\" data-hsk=\"HSK 1\"><span class=\"si\">小</span><span class=\"tr\">小</span><rt>xiǎo</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"nán hái\" data-defn=\"boy\" data-hsk=\"\"><span class=\"si\">男孩</span><span class=\"tr\">男孩</span><rt>nán hái</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"tū rán\" data-defn=\"sudden; abrupt; unexpected\" data-hsk=\"HSK 3\"><span class=\"si\">突然</span><span class=\"tr\">突然</span><rt>tū rán</rt></ruby><ruby class=\"mb-tooltip\" data-py=\"pǎo\" data-defn=\"to run / to run away / to escape / to run around (on errands